                     <display value="Hospital course note"/>
                  </coding>
               </code>
               <text>
                  <status value="generated"/>
                  <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Dear colleague, I am writing to inform you about the hospital course of your patient, a 58-year-old male admitted on 17/05/2016 with an acute exacerbation of known chronic obstructive pulmonary disease. On admission, he presented with increased dyspnoea, productive cough, and reduced oxygen saturation. Chest X-ray showed pulmonary hyperinflation without consolidation. Arterial blood gas analysis confirmed hypoxaemia with mild hypercapnia. Blood tests revealed a mild inflammatory response. He was treated with supplemental oxygen therapy, nebulised bronchodilators, systemic corticosteroids, and intravenous fluids. Clinical response was satisfactory with improvement of oxygenation and symptoms. He was discharged in stable condition on 18/05/2016. Please continue inhaled maintenance therapy and arrange outpatient pulmonary follow-up. Smoking cessation counselling was provided. Kind regards, Dr. [Treating Physician], Department of Internal Medicine.</div>
               </text>
